  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Step into modern family living with this near-new, standalone home at 6 Te Uru Lane. Offering a rare combination of stylish design, functional space, and a central Takapuna location, this home delivers low-maintenance living in one of the North Shore’s most desirable school zones.\r\n\r\nPerfect for families who value education, convenience, and comfort, this home presents an exceptional opportunity to secure affordable quality in a premium location.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It:\r\n\r\nTop School Zones:\r\n• Zoned for Takapuna Primary, Takapuna Intermediate, Westlake Boys’, Westlake Girls’, and Takapuna Grammar.\r\n• Enjoy peace of mind knowing your children have access to Auckland’s top schools.\r\n\r\nModern, Low-Maintenance Build:\r\n• Standalone freehold title – no body corporate fees.\r\n• Solid construction with concrete foundation and weatherboard cladding.\r\n• Generous floor area of approximately 175sqm, plus a large attic for extra storage or flexible use.\r\n\r\nSpacious & Flexible Layout:\r\n• Four double bedrooms, including a private master suite with ensuite.\r\n• Two full bathrooms plus an additional guest toilet on the ground floor – ideal for busy households and visitors.\r\n• Three separate living areas – perfect for family time, working from home, or a kids’ retreat.\r\n• Separate laundry room for added practicality and everyday ease.\r\n\r\nEntertainer’s Kitchen & Living:\r\n• Modern kitchen fitted with quality BOSCH appliances.\r\n• Open-plan layout flows effortlessly to a sunny dining and living area.\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor connection to the private backyard and deck – great for entertaining.\r\n\r\nComfort & Convenience:\r\n• Internal-access garage plus an extra off-street parking space.\r\n• Ample storage throughout to keep your home tidy and organised.\r\n• Approximately 7 years remaining on the Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendors – Act Now\r\n\r\nThis is a smart buy for families seeking location, space, and quality at a competitive price. With motivated vendors ready to meet the market, now is the time to make your move.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing – 6 Te Uru Lane could be the perfect place to call home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
